Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.15,0:00:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Please hold onto the side belt of the escalator.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.02,0:00:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Thank you very much for coming.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.40,0:00:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I get this one? How about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mami!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.05,0:00:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How about this? This one is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.86,0:00:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you decided?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.17,0:00:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, don’t be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.38,0:00:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're taking too long to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.34,0:00:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Give her some time to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.49,0:01:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.15,0:01:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mom! You know me well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.05,0:01:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok then!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.01,0:01:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mami, what are you going to do with those?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.27,0:01:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying them on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.47,0:01:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,All of them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.58,0:01:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, all of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.08,0:01:26.24,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1450,0)}Esper Mami - Dancing Dolls upon the Starry Sky
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.07,0:02:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.40,0:02:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! The emergency bell! I got to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.71,0:02:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Where was it...? I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.07,0:02:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mami, have you made up your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.97,0:02:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.93,0:02:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, nice... hey, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.94,0:02:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to the restroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.59,0:02:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.25,0:03:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's them...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.56,0:03:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.87,0:03:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.77,0:03:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They were there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.87,0:03:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, they left this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.19,0:03:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.54,0:03:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They said that they're quitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.80,0:03:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We lost two more members...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.61,0:03:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What will we do, Hideki?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.51,0:03:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The kids are waiting. We have to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.37,0:03:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have enough people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.32,0:03:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to come up with another plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.23,0:03:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.13,0:03:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.83,0:03:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.04,0:03:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mean to be rude, but it looks as if you need some help. I could help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.36,0:03:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you all doing here? The kids are waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.07,0:03:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay! Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.83,0:03:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.18,0:03:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you come with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.43,0:03:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.80,0:04:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! A puppet show!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.71,0:04:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.76,0:04:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.97,0:04:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.27,0:04:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.38,0:04:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.08,0:04:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.45,0:04:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Ms. Sakura Mami, your parents are waiting for you on the second floor lounge room.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.82,0:04:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Please come to the second floor lounge room.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.14,0:05:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come here, Little Red Riding Hood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.05,0:05:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to eat her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.07,0:05:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.63,0:05:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought some wine and flowers for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.29,0:05:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Red Riding Hood, I was waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.86,0:05:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come a little closer. I want to see your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.82,0:05:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.87,0:05:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.83,0:05:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be eaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.43,0:05:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not your grandma, that's a wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.80,0:05:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What big ears you have, Grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.96,0:05:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All the better to hear you, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.62,0:05:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.12,0:05:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What a big mouth you have, Grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.03,0:05:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All the better...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.14,0:06:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,...to eat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.70,0:06:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, Little Red Riding Hood!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.96,0:06:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.51,0:06:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't eat her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.53,0:06:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How nice! Everyone's into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.51,0:06:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.77,0:06:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.23,0:06:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where have you been?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.83,0:06:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.19,0:06:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We were so worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.14,0:06:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We were looking for you in every department.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.50,0:06:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.02,0:06:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, as punishment, I'll skip a meal tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.63,0:06:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.88,0:06:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're skipping dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.97,0:07:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll skip a meal with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.34,0:07:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Konpoko, it's dinner time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.15,0:07:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.26,0:07:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m so hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.65,0:07:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You were in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.31,0:07:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.17,0:07:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.22,0:07:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Konpoko was bad, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back my mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.62,0:08:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Megumi, let’s go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.84,0:08:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.79,0:08:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, don't be so silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.60,0:08:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.36,0:08:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I want my mommy back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.12,0:08:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,She calls her doll, "Mommy".
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.58,0:08:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,A doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.28,0:08:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Megumi liked the doll, but I had to throw it away with the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.30,0:08:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a reason I had to...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.11,0:08:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back my mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.92,0:08:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I want it, I want it! I want it back...!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.14,0:08:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Megumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.24,0:09:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.51,0:09:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll look for your doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.73,0:09:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't cry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.52,0:09:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow... this will be hard, but I have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.03,0:09:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you help me, Konpoko?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.23,0:09:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.19,0:10:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.59,0:10:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I threw it away this morning with the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.55,0:10:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you live?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.95,0:10:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.81,0:10:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that area's garbage has already been burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.47,0:10:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.36,0:10:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Megumi will understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.73,0:10:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.99,0:10:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,She said there was a reason. Why did Shizu throw the doll away?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.91,0:10:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to know why Megumi calls her doll "Mommy".
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.73,0:10:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to Megumi's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.44,0:10:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.34,0:11:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm alone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.11,0:11:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, what a big house!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.57,0:11:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.32,0:11:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think children will like this plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.48,0:11:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I've told you so many times! What is the purpose of our show?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.45,0:11:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I want another idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.40,0:11:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.55,0:11:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks so scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's your tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.52,0:11:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.59,0:11:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Megumi's mother passed away six months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.90,0:11:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.77,0:11:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Since then, Megumi treated her doll as if it was her mother. Her mother made the doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.29,0:12:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It was okay as long as she took good care of the doll. However, she stopped talking to anyone except her doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.56,0:12:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,She didn't want to play with her friends. She always stayed in her room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.28,0:12:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We had to do something about it. Therefore, I asked Shizu to throw away the doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.30,0:12:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.86,0:12:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Megumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.76,0:12:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Megumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.33,0:12:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.01,0:13:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... You want me to make a doll that looks just like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.22,0:13:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.18,0:13:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I could make something similar to it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.08,0:13:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,However, what her father did would have been undone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.94,0:13:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The most important thing for Megumi is for her to face reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.61,0:13:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.97,0:13:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There could be a way. Let's think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.48,0:13:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.01,0:13:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Megumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.47,0:13:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Megumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.80,0:14:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying? What are you so sad about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.26,0:14:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know! It's because you lost the doll your mother made for you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.83,0:14:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,H-How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.03,0:14:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I know a lot about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.69,0:14:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.70,0:14:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a scary witch. I can change crying children into pumpkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.57,0:14:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, witch! No one is crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.28,0:14:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I know there is someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.84,0:14:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, here's one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.80,0:14:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,See? She's crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.16,0:14:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Kaguya, please don't cry. She'll turn you into a pumpkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.43,0:14:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't have a mother or father...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.59,0:15:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh, heh... you {\b0}ARE{\b1} crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.20,0:15:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I hear another crying child.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.56,0:15:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Witch, no one is crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.42,0:15:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I know there's someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.28,0:15:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinocchio, don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.34,0:15:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.84,0:15:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're crying so much. I'll be so happy to change you into a pumpkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.07,0:15:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinocchio, don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.18,0:15:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't be human. I don't have a mother or father...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.80,0:15:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Crying children will become like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.21,0:15:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Witch, you're so mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.37,0:15:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That reminds me, Snow White... You don't have a mother either, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.94,0:16:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.19,0:16:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.80,0:16:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but I have...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.05,0:16:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You have what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.71,0:16:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I have... I have the seven dwarfs. I have friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.08,0:16:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,They're still not your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.78,0:16:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you say something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.59,0:16:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,See? Now, you're sad. Cry now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.65,0:16:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll turn you into a pumpkin, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.01,0:16:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.12,0:16:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Cry now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.51,0:16:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Don't cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.28,0:17:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't disturb us, Megumi. Snow White is about to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.75,0:17:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No, she won't cry. Isn't that right, Snow White?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.46,0:17:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.37,0:17:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I have my very kind grandfather. I'm not going to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.53,0:17:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I have my grandparents, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.74,0:17:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I have... I have my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.70,0:17:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.46,0:17:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a mean witch! Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.33,0:17:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.71,0:17:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy! Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.85,0:18:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.75,0:18:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.82,0:18:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That must have been such a nice experience for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.58,0:18:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.99,0:18:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The puppet show is very appealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.65,0:18:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They take good care of the puppets very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.22,0:18:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They clean and fix them every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.43,0:18:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Each puppet has great memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.72,0:18:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dream job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.73,0:19:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, any job has some hardships...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.19,0:19:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you know what? I'm going to make a puppet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.45,0:19:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, can I use your tools?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.46,0:19:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.12,0:19:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put some clay around the base and make it a pretty dog puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.00,0:19:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... It kinda resembles a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.76,0:19:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to paint it well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.82,0:19:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops! I put too much paint. Now, it looks funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.88,0:19:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The tail is too big. It looks like a fox.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.75,0:19:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. This is Konpoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.72,0:19:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Konpoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.99,0:20:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Konpoko has no sense of humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.90,0:20:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Konpoko! Wait up, Konpoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.57,0:20:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Konpoko, do you think this puppet can enter the puppet show?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.48,0:20:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think I could turn Konpoko into a Panda!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.30,0:20:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.65,0:20:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.39,0:20:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.74,0:20:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.05,0:20:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.72,0:20:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, stop harassing us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.27,0:20:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.78,0:20:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do we have to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.25,0:21:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better leave before someone gets hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.51,0:21:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.36,0:21:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.57,0:21:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The landlord told us it was okay for us to use this building.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.93,0:21:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Our company purchased this land!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.34,0:21:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They said they can negotiate as soon as you are gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.60,0:21:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, you can't stay here any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.46,0:21:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You stupid guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.62,0:21:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.84,0:21:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.54,0:21:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.61,0:21:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn... I'll be back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.75,0:22:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to do anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.26,0:22:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,An earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.23,0:22:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here, or else we'll crush you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.77,0:22:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.14,0:22:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.75,0:22:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.35,0:22:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- Get out of my way!\N- Do you want to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.11,0:22:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.77,0:23:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.53,0:23:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Perverts!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.40,0:23:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? You want to quit... all of you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.67,0:23:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.87,0:23:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to be married.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.48,0:23:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.63,0:24:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This situation isn't good. We can't get married like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.60,0:24:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wonder about the future, you'll know what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.67,0:24:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But... you're going to give up your dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.17,0:24:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised each other that we'll continue performing wonderful puppet shows!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.14,0:24:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.14,0:24:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I've thought about it as well, Tomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.36,0:24:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I did enjoy so many things while we were away making so many kids smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.04,0:24:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.00,0:24:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't continue living in this dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.46,0:24:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive us... Kubo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.91,0:25:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I cleaned up all the broken glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.02,0:25:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry... and thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.82,0:25:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What will you do after this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.24,0:25:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they quitting? You guys perform such wonderful puppet shows!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.50,0:25:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! We've been doing these since we were students...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.86,0:25:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand them... they put a lot of thought into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.54,0:25:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for yelling...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.79,0:25:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.23,0:25:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m so tired...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.34,0:26:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make some coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.64,0:26:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you wouldn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.60,0:26:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going back to my hometown...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.31,0:26:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! We can find new members and start again!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.28,0:26:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.99,0:26:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right. We can't continue living this dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.17,0:26:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.84,0:26:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for helping us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.35,0:26:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We've made such nice memories. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.71,0:26:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No... you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.24,0:27:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking about something funny...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.99,0:27:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.25,0:27:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember when we went to the real estate agency to rent the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.32,0:27:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you want to rent the house. Are you two married?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.24,0:27:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Umm... We're...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.34,0:27:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We're puppets!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.11,0:27:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean... we make puppet shows together.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.27,0:27:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop laughing so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.18,0:28:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I didn't mean to make you sad...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.20,0:28:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.86,0:28:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll collect puppets from all over the world and make a one-of-a-kind show!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.28,0:28:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}The train will be leaving soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.99,0:28:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.40,0:28:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand you, Mami, but we can't do anything about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.07,0:28:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.77,0:28:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.83,0:28:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If we could have stopped him, Tomoko would've stopped him by now!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.90,0:28:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomo, sorry, no... thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.22,0:28:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, but the puppets are...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.58,0:28:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The puppets?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.87,0:29:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomoko...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.08,0:29:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it... is it really over now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.87,0:29:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What can we do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.73,0:30:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,They have given up their dream. There's nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.30,0:30:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless their puppets could talk to them to convince...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.83,0:30:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it! Thank you, Takahata!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.79,0:30:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.27,0:30:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mami, what are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.08,0:30:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A puppet show!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.94,0:30:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.06,0:33:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop crying. This was meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.62,0:33:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They abandoned us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.28,0:33:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What can we do now? They don't want to make puppet shows any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.23,0:34:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop crying now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.54,0:34:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, stop it. It's too late to cry now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.20,0:34:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What will happen to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.81,0:34:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Maybe we'll be thrown in the garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.47,0:34:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We might get eaten by wild dogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.45,0:34:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, does this mean Pinocchio's stories won't be told any more?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.46,0:34:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.77,0:34:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see the kids again!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.30,0:34:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, please stop crying. Hideki will come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.52,0:34:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Puppet shows can't be performed by one person.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.53,0:35:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You are silly!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.18,0:35:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomoko will be there!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.49,0:35:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Two people aren't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.50,0:35:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I know they can start again. They have great teamwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.42,0:35:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolf, let's wait for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.78,0:35:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could think like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.29,0:35:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But... do you really think they'll be back?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.86,0:35:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes they will.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.06,0:35:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He isn't going to give up his dream easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.88,0:35:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He will be back!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.64,0:35:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's wait for him! I'll keep believing in him!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.45,0:35:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.61,0:35:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s wait! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.31,0:36:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Until then, we'll keep performing the shows! We'll have more members soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.98,0:36:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.04,0:36:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.76,0:36:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hideki... Hideki...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.88,0:36:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to return to the Moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.70,0:36:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here to bring you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.27,0:36:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You said we could continue living our dream, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.84,0:37:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,...giving up our dream is harder than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.25,0:37:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We have so many dreams that we can share with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.73,0:37:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.80,0:37:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It may be a little late to tell you this...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.97,0:37:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'll forgive me... we can go back and start again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.71,0:37:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgive you!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.71,0:38:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Good for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.41,0:38:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it good for them, Konpoko?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.51,0:38:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, this is Sakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.37,0:38:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What? "Kokeshiza"?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.93,0:38:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I want them to be in our TV show.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.49,0:38:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought your daughter, Mami, knows them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.06,0:38:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.07,0:38:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up Mami. I don't know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.93,0:38:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.18,0:39:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mami!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.75,0:39:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This feel so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.31,0:39:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We better hurry up before my mother comes to wake me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.42,0:39:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.50,0:39:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.52,0:39:34.26,SongsJap,,0,0,0,,<i>I'm not suggesting I like you but
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.50,0:39:38.99,SongsJap,,0,0,0,,<i>you'll find a stolen love letter in your locker
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.43,0:39:43.65,SongsJap,,0,0,0,,<i>A rumor of romance can draw two people together
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.09,0:39:49.34,SongsJap,,0,0,0,,<i>Oh, oh, I am sensitive, passionate and still alone
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.90,0:39:54.28,SongsJap,,0,0,0,,<i>Whistling, I blow a kiss to the summer winds
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.36,0:39:58.66,SongsJap,,0,0,0,,<i>I tear a page from English dictionary
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.06,0:40:02.80,SongsJap,,0,0,0,,<i>Through magic, wanted my boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.84,0:40:07.30,SongsJap,,0,0,0,,<i>Tough luck, that paper plane hit the teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.54,0:40:11.92,SongsJap,,0,0,0,,<i>Teleportation, my heart's wings
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.04,0:40:16.22,SongsJap,,0,0,0,,<i>Teleportation, cause the moment to go fast
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.34,0:40:24.85,SongsJap,,0,0,0,,<i>It's one-sided, and my love has gone unrequited
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.17,0:40:29.55,SongsJap,,0,0,0,,<i>Teleportation, my heart's wings
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.67,0:40:33.77,SongsJap,,0,0,0,,<i>Teleportation, cause the moment to go fast
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.89,0:40:42.61,SongsJap,,0,0,0,,<i>It's one-sided, and my love has gone unrequited
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.33,0:41:00.13,SongsJap,,0,0,0,,<i>It's one-sided, and my love has gone unrequited
